Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:29.77,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,As far as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.79,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I've never done anything that would \Nmake humans want to slay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:37.56,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,At times, I've even been their ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:41.05,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Perhaps there are things that bind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.31,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,No excuses, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.64,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:04.73,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I've lived a little too long...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:15.82,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's a less than fitting \Nend for an ancient, divine dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:18.45,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,that's been alive since the age of gods...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:24.25,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,But maybe the world can have one \Ndragon meet its end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:37.44,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Oh, grim reapers, take my \Nsoul to the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:41.57,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,so that I may rest eternally...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.96,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,He's been born? You did it, Arsena!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.53,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Shut up! You shouldn't be \Nthat loud around the mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:57.90,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Look, his eyes are open already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:03.28,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Amazing! Perhaps he's gifted in some manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:05.68,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,Well, he's my son, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:12.08,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Hello, my baby. Your name is Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:15.92,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,I'm your mom, and this is your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.61,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,And this is your big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:40.47,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Dolan, let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.94,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.59,0:03:02.37,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's nothing, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:08.87,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:54.02,Ep_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Dragon Life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:59.02,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Verun, a small village on the north border \Nof the continental kingdom of Arcrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:06.03,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,After I died as a dragon, by some strange \Nfate I was born here, as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:14.54,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,The only industry here is agriculture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:20.67,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Every day I go out into the fields and \Nwork hard to earn my daily bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:34.18,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,In the village, \Nyou're considered an adult at age 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.94,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,and you're expected to live on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:44.03,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm 16 now, so I left my home \Nlast year and now I live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:53.33,Main,Dylan,0,0,0,,Hey, Dolan. Tomorrow's the day you're \Ngoing to investigate that swamp, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.58,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:57.71,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's been a month since the lizards \Ndisappeared from the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:00.00,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.00,Main,Dylan,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be the garrison's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:07.13,Main,Dylan,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:13.10,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Brother, Captain Balan and the others have \Ntheir hands full guarding the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.39,Main,Dylan,0,0,0,,You sure you don't want me to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.10,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.98,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm just going to check it out—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:23.57,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:25.03,Main,Dylan,0,0,0,,It's a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Hey, Dolan. Big catch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.16,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.37,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,This looks like quite a big meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:40.71,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be preparing \Nfor tomorrow, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:44.00,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I've been preparing little by \Nlittle for the past several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:47.80,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,You helped me a lot by persuading \Nthe village chief and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:52.09,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,Well, you always help me with our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:55.14,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Malida, Albert, are the \Ntwo of you heading out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:59.02,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,Yes, we have a meeting about the next \Ntraining session for the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:03.02,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us. \NPrioritize your investigation tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:03.98,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:09.78,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,There are a lot of monsters \Naround Verun, as well as bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:13.95,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,And there aren't enough soldiers to give \Nthe protection you'd find in a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:17.49,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,The villagers are expected \Nto help protect themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:23.96,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Dolan, it's magic practice \Nday. Did you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.25,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Hey, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:27.00,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Is it that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.72,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Did you come to get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.80,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,I was out on an errand already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:40.85,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Laws of power, hear my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:42.90,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Become an arrow and pierce my foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.36,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Energy bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.07,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:56.12,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Yes, as always, \Nyour offensive magic is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.91,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's thanks to your teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:02.71,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Now we'll practice magical \Nmedicines, your worst subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:04.96,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,We'll spend a lot of time on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.96,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.10,Main,Chief,0,0,0,,Dolan, allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.06,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.56,Main,Chief,0,0,0,,This is Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:28.11,Main,Chief,0,0,0,,She'll be staying in our \Nvillage for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:33.36,Main,Chief,0,0,0,,She's a young noble lady. \NBe on your best behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:37.24,Main,Christina,0,0,0,,I'm Christina. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.54,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:57.22,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Christina, was it? \NShe seems quite skilled...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:06.69,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,In the village, you risk \Nfreezing to death in winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.52,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,and it's incredibly hot in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:18.66,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,I was shocked to find out humans \Nlived in such a harsh environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.62,Main,Marco,0,0,0,,Oh, Brother Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:29.54,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.21,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,You're back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:32.80,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:34.38,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.51,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I brought you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.64,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Wow, look at it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.89,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.60,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Your cooking is always the best, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:55.94,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,Dolan, living on your own may be \Nrelaxing, but you must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.82,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,Why not get a wife who's a \Ngood cook, like Dylan did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.20,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Brother says the same thing sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.00,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,But I think I want to enjoy the single \Nlife for a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:11.96,Main,Marco,0,0,0,,You're going to that \Nswamp tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:15.46,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Yeah, the one where the \Nlizards used to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:19.47,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,It's a long ways away, \Nand isn't the road dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:21.47,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I won't be taking risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:24.81,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm just going to get near it\N and look at the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.02,Main,Arsena,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:26.73,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:30.77,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,You're an adult now, so it's \Nyour decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.23,0:10:32.31,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:37.32,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,But come back safe so \Nyour mom doesn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.11,Main,Golaon,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:40.53,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:44.66,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm sure I'll \Nhave a great story to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.83,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,This is a bit too much, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.38,Main,Balan,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.00,Main,Balan,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be \Na job for us soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.71,Main,Balan,0,0,0,,I think I'll go after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:58.09,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:02.22,Main,Malida,0,0,0,,What if monsters attack \Nwhile you're gone, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:05.93,Main,Letisha,0,0,0,,Let me give you a simple goddess's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:08.73,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Thank you, Letisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:14.77,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Dolan, I don't want to scare you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:18.99,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,but my fortune-telling is showing \Nthe tiniest hint of something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.86,Main,Maguru,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:22.87,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:26.12,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Um, I made you lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.79,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Eat it on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:32.50,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Sure. Thanks, Airi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:38.71,Main,Marco,0,0,0,,Bye! Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:44.30,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,The lizards in the swamp would occasionally \Ninteract with Verun village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:48.85,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,But one day they just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:53.52,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Since we couldn't just do nothing, \NI volunteered to investigate what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:58.44,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Now, what am I going to find...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:11:59.99,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,So this is the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.59,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:24.89,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,This explains why the \Nlizards can't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:29.81,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,The earth elementals' power is too strong \Nand the water elementals' power is weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:33.98,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Old Lady Maguru's fortune-telling \Nis usually right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:40.94,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Something's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:46.45,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Only a powerful monster could \Nlive in this swamp currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:58.67,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Y-You came here alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.63,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Foolish human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.68,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,A lamia, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:13.06,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,You don't usually see them around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:18.11,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Though I see... She's as \Nbeautiful as the rumors say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:21.69,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Are you all alone, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.11,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:25.45,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Nobody else is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.99,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,W-Whew! I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.08,Italics,Celina,0,0,0,,Um, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.95,Italics,Celina,0,0,0,,I think I'm supposed to use charm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:37.00,Italics,Celina,0,0,0,,and then do those movements mom \Ntaught me over and over again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:44.88,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,What are those strange movements?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:50.60,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Human! I did not come to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.03,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.24,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:26.09,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:30.34,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Just what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:33.76,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,It's a mad earth elemental.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:36.85,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,An elemental? I've never seen one like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:42.06,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,There used to be lizards who lived \Nhere, but they all vanished one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:43.86,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,That thing is probably why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.28,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I heard there was a big \Nearthquake a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:50.36,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,That probably affected the elemental.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:53.53,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it won't go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:56.66,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:57.96,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.33,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I'm Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:04.25,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I've heard all lamias \Ncan use magic. Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:07.13,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Oh... Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:08.67,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:12.76,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion. \NWhy don't we fight it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:21.48,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,But! But! Lamia are earth monsters, \Nso I don't think I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:25.19,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,So your magic can't really damage it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:28.24,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,But, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:35.62,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I think the lamia's unique racial spell \Nwill work on an earth elemental...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:36.66,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:42.17,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,How about this? I'll go out in \Nfront and you can back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.51,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.30,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,In sickness and in health, \Ntill death do us part...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.68,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you say \Nwhen you get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.19,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:11.78,Italics,Celina,0,0,0,,I just met this human... I don't know \Nif I can work together with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.28,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,That's the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:31.09,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Accursed demon snake that flows within me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:35.18,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Come forth and curse my foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.89,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Jaraam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:45.35,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.94,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,No, it can't hold it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:53.78,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,That's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.75,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,If I imbue my sword with draconic magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.43,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:31.40,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I'm all muddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.86,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:37.36,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,It got in my mouth, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:41.70,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Indeed. You don't seem hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.83,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:47.12,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.25,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm Dolan from Verun village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.88,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I'm Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.63,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm a lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.63,0:17:58.22,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Celina? Yes, that's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:02.51,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,First, we need to clean you \Nup and dry your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.02,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,You must be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.39,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:23.45,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You're not scared of me \Nat all, are you, Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.79,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:28.92,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,You seem different from the lamias I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.38,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,What kind do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:36.84,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,They're more wary of humans, \Nand more aggressive, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:40.39,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,There aren't any lamia villages around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.10,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.97,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,When a lamia turns 17,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:49.19,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,there's a rule that says they \Nhave to leave to find a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.23,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,And that's what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.53,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Yes. In accordance with that rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:57.28,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I'm going on a journey to find a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.61,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.91,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Lamia are an all-female race,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.87,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,so we only give birth to girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:09.87,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Very rarely, we'll give birth to a boy, \Nbut it's always of our husbands' race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:16.01,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Lamia are a race that were created \Nwhen a female human was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.30,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,That curse was passed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:22.39,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,We're partially snakes, and our \Nbody fluids contain poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:31.56,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,So we need to choose a husband who's got \Na strong body and is resistant to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.36,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:42.87,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Um... when we k-kiss... or m-make babies...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:46.62,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,the man will die from poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:52.17,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I see. So it's harder to find a partner \Nfor you than it is for other races.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:56.63,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,My mom met my dad on a journey, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:20:01.43,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,He was a human, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:05.76,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,They get along great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.64,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,That's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.73,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,A-Are you treating me like a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.31,0:20:14.02,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:17.78,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I was just thinking you're \Na very cute lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:19.61,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,C-Cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.24,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You {\i1}are{\i0} treating me like a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:25.03,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:27.87,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:36.13,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm not as good a cook as my mom, \Nbut I think this is pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:43.68,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:46.64,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,What is it? I've never had it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.68,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,It smells good and it's really rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.56,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Is it made with milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:55.56,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Sorry... I got excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.40,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:59.90,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,My mom taught me how to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:05.82,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,On cold winter nights, we all \Ngathered around the pot to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.37,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You have such a kind smile when \Nyou talk about your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.42,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You love your family, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:19.21,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:25.63,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,The dragon in the cave who \Nwas all alone is gone now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:29.60,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:33.27,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:40.36,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking that you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:44.32,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I love my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.32,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,So do I!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:03.30,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find a great partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:04.97,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:11.22,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Hm... I've heard lamias like life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:21.69,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Sorry, did I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:29.24,Italics,Dolan,0,0,0,,Hmm. Perhaps a dragon's life \Nenergy was too strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:44.63,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm going back to my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:49.80,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,I'm going to head south and \Nkeep looking for a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:56.35,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,When your journey's over, \Ncome by my village with your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:22:59.19,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,I'll introduce my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:01.61,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,Okay! I definitely will!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:05.99,Main,Dolan,0,0,0,,May the path you walk be a blessed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.61,Main,Celina,0,0,0,,You too, Dolan. Be well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:59.94,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(113,301)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.06,0:24:07.89,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,This week's lucky item is spirit crystals!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.89,0:24:09.57,Main,Airi,0,0,0,,Look forward to next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,
